Package: uzunyx-outline
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: kwin-wayland (>= @KWIN@), kwin-wayland (<< @KWIN@.~)
Conflicts: waifbian-outline
Replaces: waifbian-outline
Description: thin outline around windows that draw their own frame
 KWin effect that adds a 1 px light outline with 8 px rounded corners to
 windows with client-side decorations (Firefox, Electron apps, GTK and
 libadwaita apps), matching the outline of the uzunyx window decoration.
 Windows with a server-side decoration are left alone. The outline is
 brighter on the active window.
 .
 Built against one exact KWin version: KWin refuses to load it in any
 other, so it must be rebuilt after every KWin update.
